*** oswego-tables.pgm — Epi Info 7 Classic Analysis program (Epiora v0.1 Task 3 spike)
*** READ the Oswego view in the Sample project shipped in the Epi Info 7
*** repo (requires FipsCrypto.dll configured as the config's
*** TextEncryptionModule — the shipped .prj connection strings are
*** encrypted with it; run-pgm.ps1 seeds and patches the config), run a
*** VANILLA x ILL 2x2 TABLES command, route output to HTML, then QUIT so the
*** Analysis.exe process exits on its own (required for headless CI use).
*** run-pgm.ps1 substitutes @SAMPLE_PRJ@ and @OUTPUT_HTML@ with absolute
*** paths and saves the result as *.pgm7 — Analysis.exe only picks up
*** command-line arguments whose file name contains ".pgm7".
READ {@SAMPLE_PRJ@}:Oswego
ROUTEOUT "@OUTPUT_HTML@" REPLACE
TABLES VANILLA ILL
CLOSEOUT
QUIT
